includes a device-control capability layer derived from Reticle.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1) Shizuku API (RikkaApps/Shizuku-API, dev.rikka.shizuku:api / :provider 13.1.5) — MIT License
   Used to run shell commands as the ADB (shell) or root user (device_shell, device_install,
   device_uninstall, device_force_stop, device_settings, device_input, device_screencap).
   Shizuku itself is a separate application installed by the user; it is not bundled here.
   The app also supports Sui (the Magisk module) automatically through the same API.

2) Google ML Kit text-recognition (bundled Chinese model) — Google ML Kit Terms of Service
   Used for offline on-screen text recognition (device_ocr). No ML Kit binaries are
   redistributed by this repository; the dependency is resolved from Google's Maven repository.

3) AndroidX / AppCompat / Material Components / Kotlin stdlib / Ktor / Coil / Room and other
   libraries — Apache-2.0, MIT or equivalent; see each project for details.

