Scope note for Air-Ko
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Air-Ko does NOT include the Shizuku API or Liquid Glass for Android. Device control is built
entirely on the Android accessibility service, so the third-party obligations of Reticle's
NOTICE items 1-2 do not apply to this application. Google ML Kit (item 3) is used as a normal
Gradle dependency under its own terms; no ML Kit binaries are redistributed by this repository.
